# Left: the corpses' loot, the dead end to the Academy's view, DSimpson's
# tip of walking past the Greater Storm Beast by the right wall.
#
# ASSUMES:
#   Mira available (NPC 7): a_flank_cs switches to her, else straight to the
#   remote (901MAL). # UNSURE: the `talk`/`fight 40`/`say` block for Mira
#   then finds no conversation; if the chain's save lacks her, cut it.
#   # UNSURE: whether the harness plays the switched seat (Mira as the
